begin function { ref rItem }

	; UDFs

	ref GetBaseAddictionChanceUDF = CompileScript "SaintsTransientAddictions\Items\GetBaseAddictionChance.gek"

	; Main

	if eval !(GetAddictionEffect rItem)
		return
	endif

	float fBaseAddictionChance = Call GetBaseAddictionChanceUDF rItem

	if fBaseAddictionChance == (-1.0)
		PrintC "[STA] Could not restore base addiction chance for item '%n', missing base chance entry." rItem
		return
	endif

	SetAddictionChance rItem fBaseAddictionChance

end
